---
description: Mandatory step-finish presentation and written review
alwaysApply: true
---

- Before a guide step is considered complete, follow `skills/step-finish-presentation.md`.
- Each completed step must commit `docs/step-reviews/STEP-<id>/README.md` and `slides.md` in the **same** step PR (split steps: one folder per sub-step PR).
- When the step is finished, set that step’s `- [x] Done` checkbox in `.DOCS/ALFDF-MVP0-Stepbystep-Guide-v0.md` in that **same** step PR — do not defer a guide-only follow-up on `main` after merge (one step = one PR).
- `README.md` must include whole-project progress (phase/step tally or pointer to `.DOCS/ALFDF-MVP0-Stepbystep-Guide-v0.md` checklists), exact commands and test outcomes, benchmark outcomes or `Benchmarks: not applicable` with reason, and a **Review** section.
- The PR body must link that folder. Optional `presentation.html` or `presentation.pdf` only when export tooling already exists or the PR justifies a new dependency.
